fill 2330 1903 2360 1919 wood
fill 2334 1906 2340 1911 glass
fill 2350 1906 2356 1911 glass
fill 2341 1895 2349 1897 wood
fill 2337 1897 2353 1899 wood
fill 2333 1899 2357 1901 wood
fill 2329 1901 2361 1903 wood
carve 2329 1895 2361 1919
// a 40x10 lava pool in a basalt basin, held hot by lava sources in its floor and at its surface
fill 2384 1910 2436 1922 basalt
fill 2390 1910 2430 1920 lava
fill 2404 1920 2416 1922 lava_source
fill 2406 1910 2414 1912 lava_source
// tree, body 5
fill 2463 1907 2488 1912 soil
fill 2473 1877 2477 1907 wood
circle 2475 1877 12 leaves
carve 2463 1865 2488 1907
// brick house with a timber roof, body 6
fill 2509 1898 2543 1906 stone
fill 2510 1878 2542 1898 brick
fill 2515 1882 2521 1888 glass
fill 2531 1882 2537 1888 glass
fill 2521 1870 2531 1872 wood
fill 2517 1872 2535 1874 wood
fill 2513 1874 2539 1876 wood
fill 2509 1876 2543 1878 wood
carve 2509 1870 2543 1898
// wooden house, body 7
fill 2569 1885 2601 1894 stone
fill 2570 1869 2600 1885 wood
